WEBVTT

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:04.670
Matsudo Heisuke appeared
in front of Yoshimori

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:07.000
who had been captured
by the Kokuboro.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:14.010
He was there to end
a long-entrenched rivalry.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.310
I found you.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:24.750
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.620
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:31.830
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:33.730
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:37.170
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:41.570
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:45.110
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:48.440
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:54.110
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:58.610
Sha la la la la...

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:05.030
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:07.000
(Secret romance)

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:12.200
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.960
(A strange distance)

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:20.810
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:21.880
Yeah

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:25.350
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:28.950
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:34.290
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:01:56.850 --> 00:02:00.340
Wait. Don't run from me.

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:09.860
The time has come...

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:12.660
For me to right all the wrongs
you have committed!

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:15.250
You...

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:17.890
You...

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:21.560
I will never forgive you!

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:39.450
This is the perfect place for us.

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:46.890
It's been a while, Shiranuma.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:52.530
You look very young.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:56.570
If I remember correctly,
you are nine years older than me.

00:02:56.970 --> 00:03:00.700
The modifications that you have
made to your body are done well.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:06.150
I had thought...
that you might not be dead.

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:07.510
Oh, really?

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:10.140
I never doubted that
you were alive...

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:13.480
since that night
50 years ago.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:14.880
That woman...

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:19.290
Don't use my wife's appearance
without my permission.

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:21.660
Look who's talking!

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:28.960
You never showed even
one speck of love toward her!

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:34.740
So you're the one
who dug up Lisa's grave.

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:36.670
That's right.

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:40.170
I remember it like
it was yesterday.

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:50.490
I also dug up your grave.

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:53.320
Just to make sure.

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:57.460
When I figured out
that you were not there...

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:02.260
I was relieved.
I knew you were not dead.

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:06.240
I thought you had taken her
and disappeared.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:23.810
But!

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:28.560
She was there.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:39.610
Seeing her confirmed everything.

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:42.540
She was just one of
your test subjects.

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:45.050
And you murdered her!

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:03.420
I tried everything
to bring her back to life.

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:10.200
I had never worked harder
for anything in my life.

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:22.510
Unfortunately,
no matter how hard I tried,

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:25.280
I could not revive her.

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:30.220
But I did not give up.

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:46.570
And one day, a miracle occurred.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:19.000
Do you wish to enter
into a contract with me?

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:29.180
That's right! A new door opened.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:32.040
How far into the forbidden
techniques did you delve?

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:39.530
Shiranuma, forbidden techniques
don't make miracles happen.

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:41.360
Do you know what does?

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:43.690
Love! It's love!

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:46.900
Something you will
never understand.

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:50.530
You're worthless.

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:53.840
This bottom level houses
my nest of underlings.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:57.270
I suggest that you run
before all of them gather.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:00.680
I have no reason to fight you.

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:05.210
Though I did try to kill you once.
Leave me alone.

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:08.760
Repent for your sins.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:13.030
You seem to have misunderstood.
Lisa died in an accident.

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.020
Silence!

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:18.720
Then how did you obtain
that body of yours?

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:21.060
Go!

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:15.880
You dare try to eat me?
Damned insects.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:16.880
Hey.

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:19.320
That was a breach of our contract.

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:23.760
You must always act
elegant and beautiful.

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:25.700
I forbid you to speak like that.

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:28.670
Yes, Professor.

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:33.630
You haven't changed at all,
Matsudo.

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:36.630
Still fixated on
outward appearances.

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:44.010
Quiet. I'm not an idiot like you.
You have no idea what you want.

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:47.550
Did you think you could learn
that just by living longer?

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:49.480
Answer me, Shiranuma!

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:52.350
What have you obtained
from that body?

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:55.230
A body built at the cost
of your wife's life?

00:08:57.570 --> 00:09:00.030
You don't understand anything.

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:05.140
You don't understand anything.

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:08.640
I do, Shiranuma. I understand you.

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:10.110
What do you know?

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.980
You're in the middle of
"finding yourself," right?

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:14.950
You started then and never stopped.

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:18.580
There was something
that I always sought.

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:20.850
But you're different!

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:25.180
You have to realize that
you seek nothing.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:27.860
I sought change.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:31.960
You can't change no matter
how long you live!

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:33.220
No matter what you do,

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:38.470
you will never find
what you seek, you idiot.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:40.800
Do you know why?

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:44.910
Because you're empty inside.

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:09.990
I never understood why
she fell in love with

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.600
such an empty man
like you.

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:15.740
That fact alone
makes me think that

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:18.610
there's something
terribly wrong with this world.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:22.580
Matsudo.
You are blind to the facts.

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:23.670
What?

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:26.120
She was an ugly woman.

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:30.860
You know, out of all the flowers,
I love roses the most.

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:34.020
She had a face like an angel,

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:39.430
but she manipulated me
to get what she wanted.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:43.160
I did her bidding always.

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:04.780
Her desires did not end
even after we married.

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:12.560
In the end, she wished for
eternal life and youth.

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:15.200
I made every effort
to grant that wish.

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:24.570
I couldn't understand
why women

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:27.600
wished to be young
and beautiful forever.

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:35.480
She went completely
insane in the end.

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:38.350
Please...

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:42.860
Do... the next experiment.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:46.600
And one day...

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:54.700
The experiment failed miserably,
leaving her horribly disfigured...

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:09.110
She stabbed herself in
the chest with a knife

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.320
and told me to
set fire to everything.

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:23.300
I did as she wished.
Just as I had always done.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:30.080
I took that opportunity to
disappear from society, as well.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:32.270
I was finally free.

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:34.140
Do you understand?

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:37.580
I was forced to go along with
the experiments she demanded.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:40.310
Stop babbling!

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:42.220
You are where you are
now thanks to

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:45.060
the knowledge and technology
you gained from those experiments.

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.990
You said you wished for change,

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:49.930
but the fact is that you
sacrificed your wife

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:52.630
to cover up your
empty existence.

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.360
You monster!

00:12:57.640 --> 00:13:00.700
Fine. We can leave it at that.

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:01.930
What?!

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:05.200
Isn't it enough?
That happened 50 years ago.

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:06.470
No, it's not!

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:10.650
Do you know why she wished
to have eternal youth and beauty?!

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:15.490
He grants anything I wish for.

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:18.750
But... is that really love?

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:21.390
Heisuke-san...

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:25.600
All I have is my appearance.

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:28.500
I wonder how long
he will stay with me.

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:39.610
She wished for eternal youth
so that you would stay by her side!

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:43.880
Goodness. You never change.

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:51.450
I am already in
a different place than you.

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:54.320
Don't speak to me in your terms.

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:01.060
You monster!

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:23.420
Shiranuma!

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:25.320
Be devoured!

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:29.430
Kagami-kun!

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.860
I'm sure you can eat them all.

00:14:56.820 --> 00:14:58.880
Damn it. He got away.

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.920
No, I can still smell him.

00:15:03.100 --> 00:15:05.590
Come out, Shiranuma!

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:07.990
Where did he go?

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:20.910
That surprised me.

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:31.720
I was so close.

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:35.030
Coward.

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:37.900
Your common ploy is to insert
worms into your opponent

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:39.870
to manipulate them, correct?

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:41.990
I already know that.

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:43.430
Very well.

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:47.740
Let's fight fair and square.
Let's do this, Matsudo.

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:50.940
Come on then!
You will not go unpunished!

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:56.580
What's wrong? Are you scared?

00:15:56.780 --> 00:16:00.240
You... accepted.

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:11.830
The portals have opened.

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:25.440
I can't... move my legs...

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:30.640
I use my worms to control opponents.
That's my power.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:33.310
But there is a way to
implant my worms

00:16:33.350 --> 00:16:34.980
into an uncooperative
participant.

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:38.020
I can create a temporary contract
with that opponent.

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:42.120
You were splashed with
the bodily fluids of my worms.

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:43.590
That was a marking.

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:45.860
If I can get consent
before it dissipates,

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:48.530
a portal is created where
the worms can enter.

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:54.530
I said, "Let's fight,"
and you replied, "Come on then."

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:57.210
You fell so easily for it.

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:59.610
It's helpful when
your opponent is talkative.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:06.250
Even a devil cannot
interfere with this portal.

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:08.120
Kagami-kun,

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:12.220
you should be very knowledgeable
about curses of this nature.

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:15.830
You knew, didn't you?

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:17.460
Why didn't you warn me?!

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:20.920
Were you trying to hasten my death
so you could obtain my soul earlier?!

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:23.200
You devil!

00:17:23.840 --> 00:17:25.360
Here I come!

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:29.470
I didn't think she'd
betray me here!

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:34.040
I may as well take a gamble!

00:17:34.350 --> 00:17:38.090
Here's an advance!
You can have my right arm!

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:39.710
Fight for me!

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:15.880
It took some time for me
to locate his core.

00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:17.380
You're okay.

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:20.520
There's no hole in
your skull, Professor.

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:23.420
That man isn't dead yet,

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:25.830
but he will be insect food
sooner or later.

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:30.760
Why are you making that face?

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:33.900
I'm on your side
until my last breath.

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:35.900
Oh, Professor.

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:39.270
I thought it was strange,
but that man...

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:41.110
He has made many modifications
to his body,

00:18:41.150 --> 00:18:42.270
but his foundation is still...

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:53.020
So you're still human.

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:58.420
Even in the end, you could
only do things halfway...

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:03.100
I thought you feigned your death
to live a peaceful life,

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:05.090
but you caused all this commotion.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.030
If you hadn't tried to
take over Karasumori,

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.980
I would never have found you.

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:17.550
Heisuke-san...
I don't think I have long to live.

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:22.350
He tends to lose his way
even when I'm with him.

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:26.780
So when the time comes,
please take care of him.

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:30.020
Let me tell you this...

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:31.460
In the beginning,

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:34.190
I had no intention of
bringing her back to life.

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:38.530
I knew that it would
be meaningless.

00:19:39.140 --> 00:19:42.440
I dug up your grave
just for confirmation.

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:44.940
And I took that opportunity
while I was there...

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:47.080
Really...

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:49.040
Because I knew...

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:56.120
that she would never love me.

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:58.590
Answer me!

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:01.790
Did you ever love her?

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:05.220
I...

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:20.380
I have... never loved
anyone in my life.

00:20:53.480 --> 00:21:00.010
I am powerless.
I couldn't even keep one promise.

00:21:01.020 --> 00:21:04.720
You can't save someone like that...

00:21:05.690 --> 00:21:10.390
Please don't despair.
You have me, Professor.

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:16.090
Do you know, Professor?

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:18.260
The more a soul struggles,

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:21.240
the more it shines with
the brightest of lights...

00:21:35.420 --> 00:21:39.260
Now I understand why
you can be so mean sometimes.

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:58.740
Are you sure about
not taking my right arm?

00:21:59.050 --> 00:22:01.010
I will take you whole in the end.

00:22:06.190 --> 00:22:08.180
I'm tired.

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:12.550
Take me away, Kagami-kun.

00:22:12.690 --> 00:22:14.660
Yes, Professor.

00:22:45.990 --> 00:22:51.520
10 minute break,
I wanna do so much

00:22:53.400 --> 00:22:59.430
Class is over, but someone
in the front asks a question

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:01.970
"What nerve"

00:23:02.380 --> 00:23:05.350
I'm at ease as long as
I have a mirror

00:23:05.380 --> 00:23:09.080
"Make up's on right,
my eyes look all right"

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:15.450
See, if you look behind you,
there's a girl who curled her hair

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:20.490
I hate studying,
I like P.E. okay

00:23:20.530 --> 00:23:22.430
Basketball, volleyball,
and tennis, what?

00:23:22.460 --> 00:23:27.700
You're not gonna make me
run long distance today, teacher!

00:23:27.730 --> 00:23:31.230
My face will get oily,
and I hate being sore

00:23:31.270 --> 00:23:35.330
I'm that kind of
a beautiful high school girl

00:23:49.820 --> 00:24:00.170
10 minute break, I'll get busy
drawing a map of the future
